window.products.push({"id":801080,"name":"Mag2.0 Magnetic Hooks Heavy Duty Larger Base Less Slippage Hold More Variety Value 6-Pack (2-XL, 2-L, 2-M, Nickel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YguG7KEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAUTION — Contains larger, ultra heavy duty Neodymium magnets. Not for children under 12 years old. Keep away from pacemakers.  Mag2.0 Magnetic Hooks uses: Home, kitchen, garage, office, gym, on cruise ships and other travel situations. Hang items on refrigerators, filing cabinets, metal walls, sheds, lockers and toolboxes.  Perfect for organizing in rental apartments and small spaces.  No wall damage - no drilling, nailing or sticky adhesives required.  Larger diameter base provides greater friction to hold heavier items.  Material: Made from nickel-plated neodymium. Neodymium is a rare earth metal and is the strongest permanent magnet commercially available. Magnets will stick to any ferromagnetic surface, which includes metals that contain iron (such as steel), nickel and cobalt.  Maximum Weight: The maximum weight that can be held by the hook depends on several factors, including the mounting orientation (i.e. on a vertical surface or a horizontal surface) and the type / thickness / smoothness of the metal you are mounting it on. Attached to a vertical surface, the maximum weight is roughly 2/3 less than on a horizontal surface. Mount under a horizontal metallic ceiling or beam for maximum carrying capacity.  Surface Protection: For mountings on surfaces that could be scratched, such as stainless appliances, test in an inconspicuous area first. To protect the surface, cover the magnet base bottom with a thin material (for example, a piece of tape, sticker or thin piece of rubber).  Compact: Hooks can be unscrewed from base for compact storage or transport.  100% Satisfaction Guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YguG7KEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mag 1","source_asin":"B01M7UEH4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M7UEH4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M7UEH4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
