window.products.push({"id":801181,"name":"Silver Buffalo Sanrio Hello Kitty 3D Sculpted Ceramic Mug | BPA-Free Coffee Cup For Espresso, Caffeine, Cocoa, Pink, (KTY5293D)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QE8zyCMPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOU CAN NEVER HAVE TOO MANY FRIENDS Need a drink to go with that slice of apple pie? Your friends at Sanrio have you covered with this exclusive sculpted mug designed to look just like Hello Kitty. We all know you can never have too much pink. This supercute cool cup was made to look just like the famous fashion icon. Beloved all around the world, now she's ready to take a starring role in your morning routine. Infused with all the kawaii charm you'd expect from Hello Kitty, this delightful mug has all the adorable you'll need to get you through the day. ENJOY THE KAWAII SIDE OF LIFE WITH HELLO KITTY The BPA-free ceramic design will allow you to keep your warm drinks nice and toasty, while your cold ones stay frosty and chilly. Bring something delightful to your table with the timeless aesthetic that continues the adventures of Hello Kitty. You know what they say — go pink or go home! You can never have enough Hello Kitty with officially licensed drinkware from Sanrio. CARE INSTRUCTIONS Hand wash only Not dishwasher safe Not microwave safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QE8zyCMPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silver Buffalo","source_asin":"B0BNR338YF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNR338YF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNR338YF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":801182,"name":"YouYah Wine Decanter Aerator with Stopper and Brush,Red Wine Carafe,Upgrade Iceberg,Wine Accessories, Wine Gift, Hand Blown 100% Crystal Glass(1800ML)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dwXAvvyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[FULLY HAND-MADE MASTERPIECE] – A unique design, without imitation! YouYah Wine Decanter is made from 100% high-quality, fully hand-blown, lead-free crystal. The product is expertly designed to allow maximum surface interaction of the wine with the air. [MAKES AN ARTISTIC BASE] - This elegant, iceberg-designed wine decanter is not only a tool for improving the quality of your wine, it could likewise serve as a piece of art work. It is like Mount Fuji or the Alps, standing quietly, yet majestic, while the irregular bottom also increases the contact area between wine and air. [CAREFULLY-EQUIPPED ACCESSORIES] - Besides the decanter, the package also includes a wooden stopper and a cleaning brush. You can open a bottle of red wine and pour it into the pot for decanting. If you can't finish it, just use the stopper for temporary storage. If you do finish it, you could clean it with the brush. [ONE OF THE BEST GIFTS] - With the beautiful packaging, it makes for an ideal gift to your family and friends! Trust me, this will definitely be a Big Surprise! [GOOD CHOICE] - What are you waiting for? Put YouYah decanter in your SHOPPING CART now and get ready to taste your good wines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dwXAvvyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEW PACIFIC YOUYAH","source_asin":"B07ZH9JQCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZH9JQCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZH9JQCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
