window.products.push({"id":801267,"name":"Huracan PC Game Chair Camo Camouflage Computer Gaming Chair Office Video Game Chairs with High Back Ergonomic Armrest Comfortable PU Leather Headrest ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pO4FG78bS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥇【2021 Upgrade Huracan-Military Gaming Chair】 The Camouflage pattern appears on the headrest, chair back, lumbar support, seat cushion, and armrests. They will not be covered even if you sit on the game chair. The camo connects the lumbar support and the chair back to a \"V\", symbolizing the victory of each battle. A streamlined grille design added to the armrests, making you more involved in the game character. Suitable for gamers or YouTubers when playing games or doing a game live broadcast. 🏆【Carbon Fiber Leather + PU Leather】We changed the headrest, backrest & seat cushion, which are often in contact with our body, to carbon fiber leather. It is much softer than normal leather, which is more breathable, resistant to high temperature, friction & easy to clean. Suitable for those who sit on the camo chair for a very long time. The other parts are high-quality soft PU leather, which will not crack after years of use. 🏆【ALL-round Take Care of You】Integrated cold foaming technology -- It is more elastic and more supportive, no sagging, soft and comfortable when sitting on it. Coupled with the outer leather material, the touch is very soft and delicate, very easy to clean. ALL-round high-density foam sponge filling, including the flapping wings on both sides of the seat cushion and backrest, and 3cm+ sponge filling armrests so that every inch of your body can be taken care of. 🏆【High-quality Configuration + Rotate Freely】The ergonomically ALL-STEEL construction frame provide you the reliable stress points. SGS-3 gas lift + thickened tray plate, double protection. Adjustable height: 90°-150° reclining, 360° swivel. 5 PU silent rolling wheels, quiet and wear-resistant, slide smoothly on floor tiles or carpets without scratching. The one-piece chassis has a non-slip texture, and a low low ground clearance ensures a better stability. 🎁【Perfect Gift, Excellent Service, Terrific Choice】Computer chair is a good choice for personal use, and also an ideal Valentine's Day gift or birthday gift for boyfriend or husband. Free replacement or money back for the quality reason within 30 days. Please feel free to contact us if any question or dissatisfaction, we will do our best to solve the problem and satisfy you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pO4FG78bS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huracan","source_asin":"B08MLB5BS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MLB5BS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MLB5BS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
