window.products.push({"id":801282,"name":"SunStyle Home Lightweight Comforter Twin for Kids Boys Girls Light Purple Down Alternative Comforter Soft All Seasons Bedding Set with 1 Pillow Sham","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNTYNtY5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌛PREMIUM MICROFIBER SELECTION - Extremely soft 100% brushed microfiber cover made by unique peach-skin processing technology makes the comforter ultra soft & fluffy. 🌛All-SEASON COMFORTER - 7D down alternative fiber whole-piece filling, fluffy and lightweight, not too heavy to pressure you. Well-distributed, without any concern for clumping or horrible odor. Great choice for those who can't use goose down and feather bedding. 🌛ONE COMFORTER, TWO MOOD - The two toned color can be reversed depending on your bed sheets and your mood. We offer a variety of color options to choose from to meet nearly everyone’s preference. 🌛MACHINE WASHABLE & EASY CARE - Machine washable in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat. No shrink and No fade. Which will save your a lot of time and energy. 🌛WHAT YOU CAN GET - Twin size comforter set includes 1 comforter 68\"x88\", 1 pillow sham 20\"x26\"; queen size comforter set includes 1 comforter 90\"x88\", 2 pillow shams 20\"x26\". Our down alternative comforter is vacuum packed, recommended to dry it in low heat or tap it gently while baking it in the sun for a few hours to make it fluffy again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNTYNtY5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunStyle Home","source_asin":"B092QT83ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092QT83ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092QT83ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":801283,"name":"Round Ice Cube Trays with Lid and Bin, 1.1Inch 159PCS Small Ice Cube Trays for Freezer with Container,BPA-Free Circle Ice Cube Tray Ice Ball Maker Mol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XafNyWwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Make More Ice Balls In One Go】: Our upgraded ice trays for freezer consists of one tray and a lid with small holes,each ice molds can makes 53PCS round ice balls in one go(3 pieces can produce 159PCS).So you've got enough perfect ice balls to last for yourself or if you're hosting a party.Its creative design makes for the cutest ice spheres that not only upgrade your daily sips,but will also impress any of your guests. 【User Friendly and Cute Shape Design】:Our mini ice cube trays comes with a unique design which makes every clear ice ball regular and perfectly round.Just simply rinse the round ice cube mold under water tap and fill water in.No need to pour water in one hole after another.Freezing for 6-8 hours,you can get 53 pcs sphere ice balls for each tray. 【Easy to Release into Large Ice Bin】:The plastic ice trays for freezer with bin are easier to release than other soft silicone ice cube tray.After taking the tray out of the fridge,open the lid and ice cubes release easily with just a twist into the large capacity ice bucket. The container size of 11X8.5x4 inches which can hold 200pcs ice cube balls in one go, and a small ice clip.This nugget ice tray set is perfect for a summer party. 【Food-grade Material & Safety】: Our ice tray with storage bin are made of high quality food-grade material that are non toxic and non-chemical,BPA free, no smell, keeping you and your family healthy.You can use our ice cube molds with confidence.Our small ice cube trays for freezer may become an ideal choice for your family. 【Wide Application Specialty Gadgets】:The pebble ice tray is perfect for whiskey,cocktails,coffee,infusing fruit or herbs.Try infusing mint for that perfect Mojito or strawberries for that delicious lemonade.You can also put fruits,jelly,baby food,coffee,vegetable puree,yogurt and chocolate into molds to make the ice cubes you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XafNyWwlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suogkeale","source_asin":"B0C68MJ7YN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68MJ7YN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68MJ7YN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
