window.products.push({"id":801554,"name":"SwissGear Swiss Gear Travel Pillow, Black, One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ARKp9tG7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The easiest way to travel in comfort. A quick nap can do wonders when you travel and help you arrive at your destination feeling relaxed and refreshed. Our fleece travel pillow is the perfect way to get that nap in no matter where you're traveling or how you're getting there. This u-shaped pillow is contoured to fit against your neck, comfortably supporting your head without slipping or sliding out of place. Plus, because the soft fleece cover is removable and washable, you can give your neck pillow the same fresh-laundered scent as your pillowcases at home. That may be just the thing you need to help you fall asleep en route. Durable enough to travel anywhere. Go ahead—bend it, twist it, sit on it, poke it, or pull it. You can use this travel rest pillow any way you want without worrying about popping or puncturing it, like you do with some inflatable pillows. The polyfiber filling compresses and twists to help you find that perfectly comfortable position. Then it springs right back to its original shape when you're done with your nap. About SwissGear From the maker of the genuine Swiss Army Knife, SwissGear represents the best in travel accessories for people on the move. Our products make it easier and more comfortable to take what you need with you everywhere you go. So, no matter where life's adventures take you, always go with SwissGear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ARKp9tG7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SwissGear","source_asin":"B004MKMH50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004MKMH50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004MKMH50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
