window.products.push({"id":801563,"name":"Lumaland Bean Bag Chair | 5 Foot & Navy Blue | Microsuede Cover Machine Washable Big Size Sofa and Giant Lounger Furniture for Kids Teens and Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DyTpHBU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Lumaland Luxury Bean Bag Chair is a real big size sofa. A 5-foot lounge chair fits all kinds of living rooms, bedrooms or children's rooms. Enjoy great everyday fun and relaxation. So take your time and chill out with your friends and family.The ultra soft and machine washable microsuede outer cover has a great touch and feel to it - perfect for kids, teens, and adults. And you can still use your lounge chair with the beige polyester inner cover during washing - so its a 2 in 1 lounger that can be used all the time even when the outer covering is in the washing machine. For long-lasting coziness and soft comfort, our bag inner covers are filled with high-class foam material, without any plastic parts or remnants. The foam reflects your body heat and provides absolute well-being. Get ready for a new style of modern furniture in your home. The deep colors and different sizes of the bean bag chair mean you can choose the best bean bag for own preferences. The microsuede cover is designed for daily use by children, adults, and pets - Your new bean bag chair becomes the new focus in your apartment. The maintenance is easy to handle by zippers - just put the outer cover in your washing Machine or simply use a cloth with warm water and mild cleanser. Remember there is an inner cover in the lounger so you can use your lounge chair all the time. Your Bean Bag chair will be shipped in a box with a fraction of its size and expands to full size within three days. But you can fluff it up and crush any foam clusters to support and accelerate this process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DyTpHBU8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lumaland","source_asin":"B07GR6LVQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GR6LVQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GR6LVQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
