window.products.push({"id":801637,"name":"OEM Okin Deltadrive Motor Plastic Forkhead - Shaft End","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jxBwcZvGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This is a plastic connector that screws onto the end of the DeltaDrive stroke tube (the tube that moves in and out of the actuator); the connector goes in between two lift/recline brackets, and a clevis pin goes through all that to hold it to the frame of the chair. PLEASE NOTE: This will only fit an Okin DeltaDrive actuator; please do not order this part if you have an FBS or Dewert motor, as it will not fit those model actuators. I know, some of you are thinking that \"this idiot doesn't know what he is talking about, this part looks just like mine so it should work...\" You may be right about the \"idiot\" part, but I am right about what it will fit... This part has reverse, or \"left hand\" threads, so you turn it counter-clockwise to tighten it. The FBS looks like it, but is a different diameter, and it has standard, or right hand threads. The Dewert connectors are about half the diameter of this one. If the part broke off in the stroke tube, as it normally does, just be careful when you are getting the piece out that broke off in the tube so as not to damage the threads. Any questions at all, please let us know.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jxBwcZvGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Okin","source_asin":"B01M093O6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M093O6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M093O6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
