window.products.push({"id":801668,"name":"ZENFUN Set of 10 Mini Fluted Tube Pan, 4 Inch Carbon Steel Fluted Cake Mold Cup with Flower Shape, Nonstick Cake Pan Mini Tube Oven Baking Mold for Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TpUpTHGxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zenfun set of 10 fluted tube cake pans come with cute flower shape, measures 4 inches in diameter at the top and 1.7 inches in height. With the mini cake molds, you will have a happy baking experience. Carbon Steel Material: The fluted tube pans are made of premium durable carbon steel, rust-resistant and sturdy for a long-lasting service life. With even heat distribution, which is fundamental to optimal baking results, our cake pans are great for your daily baking use. Interior Non-stick Coating: Cake mold cups are designed to deliver long-lasting, high-performance release with zero leftover residue. The tough material of the oven pan set disperses weight and heat evenly throughout the baking process for perfectly made recipes that won't get stuck or caked on the cups. ZENFUN nonstick cake molds can bake many delicious cakes such as angel food cake, brownies, monkey bread, cheese and more. They are ideal for both individual or party occasion, such as birthday, wedding, aniversary or new year party. Easy to clean: Clean the mold by hand after leaving it in warm water with liquid soap for a while after finishing baking. Dry it with a cloth after rinsing. Dishwasher is not advised as it will harm the surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TpUpTHGxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZENFUN","source_asin":"B09J2J1Q77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J2J1Q77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J2J1Q77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
