window.products.push({"id":801828,"name":"Ceephouge Food Vacuum Sealer Containers - 3pc Transparent Glass Food Storage Canisters Set with Automatic Vacuum Pump, Kitchen Airtight Sealed for Cer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sW2v0WqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥫 Food saver containers for vacuum seal: Package include 1 Ceephouge vacuum sealer pump and 3 reusable containers; large 2000ML (size 7.5×4.7 inches), medium 1200ML (size 6.7×3.9 inches), small 700ML (size 5.9×3.2 inches). 🥫 Keep fresh 5 times longer: Keep food fresh for 5 times longer than non-vacuum storage methods. The vacuum seal containers system maintains the nutrition, flavor and longevity of food. By removing most of the oxygen, oxidation can be slowed down and moisture can be prevented from entering, thereby preventing spoilage. 🥫 Easy to use: the vacuum sealer pump is placed in the middle of the vacuum container cover, and it can be turned on by one button. After the vacuum pump is completed, the power will be automatically cut off (if the indicator light is red, please charge), the back of the vacuum pump has a magnetic attraction that can be attached to metal objects, and you can magnetically attach it to the refrigerator, which is convenient take and use. 🥫 Safe and BPA-free: Food saver containers set made of borosilicate glass, can withstand temperatures from -4°F to 248°F, can be frozen, microwave safe and dishwasher safe (the vacuum state cannot be placed in the microwave, Do not put the lid in the microwave) The bottom of the jar is equipped with a removable non-slip silicone band to protect the jar and your countertop. 🥫 Versatility: The mini vacuum sealer pump can be used for vacuuming multiple items. In addition to vacuum sealed container, it is also suitable for ordinary food sealing bags and wine bottle stoppers. The 3 pack vacuum sealer containers are not only ideal for storing coffee beans, but also suitable for fruits, vegetables, cereals, snacks, biscuits, nuts, sugar, tea or some easily oxidizable foods you may need to store!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sW2v0WqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ceephouge","source_asin":"B09PDL87YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDL87YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDL87YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
