window.products.push({"id":801898,"name":"Godinger Acrylic Highball Glasses, Tall Beverage Highballs Drinking Glasses Cups, Shatterproof and Reusable Tumbler Cups - Dublin Collection, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tx+mTIL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dublin collection stunning acrylic tall highball drinking glasses are ideal for indoor or outdoor use.. Add a pop of color to your kitchen, bar, patio, picnic or pool party. Perfect for water, juice, cocktails or any beverage. Shatterproof acrylic means no need to worry about glass shattering if dropped by a guest at the pool or party. BPA-free Acrylic. Dishwasher safe. Capacity: 12oz. Since 1973 Godinger has specialized in handcrafted silver, crystal, stainless, and metal giftware. From wedding gifts, candlesticks, barware, and bakeware to tea sets and frames, you are sure to find the perfect item for any occasion. Godinger products are available at all major retailers across the US and Canada","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tx+mTIL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Godinger","source_asin":"B09T3SY3CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T3SY3CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T3SY3CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":801899,"name":"Wolfard 9 Inch Original Oil Lamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XNE6uanhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Wolfard Oil Lamp has earned an international reputation for excellence in design and function. It has been included in the prestigious Whitney Museum of American Art exhibition \"High Styles: Twentieth Century American Design,\" a review of outstanding examples of furniture, industrial design, and decorative objects. The Wolfard Oil Lamp is hand-blown from borosilicate glass (known for its strength and clarity) using an exclusive \"in-flame\" glassblowing technique which requires higher temperatures than other art glass methods. This, in turn, requires a higher degree of skill by the glassblower to form the lamp while the glass remains workable. Whether in your home or in a world class museum, Wolfard Lamps bring style and elegance to any room. All are beautifully hand-crafted and designed to be treasured for generations. They come in four sizes: 6-inches, 9-inches, 12-inches, and 15-inches in height..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XNE6uanhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Original Oil Lamp","source_asin":"B000YNOWPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000YNOWPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000YNOWPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":801900,"name":"Cekene Kitchen Rug Mat Non Slip 20”x59” Washable Kitchen Mats for Floor Kitchen Runner Rug for Kitchen Floor Entryway Hallway Laundry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ABRro4PcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Perfect Size&Low Pile]--The kitchen rug measures 20”x59”, featuring a low-profile design. Perfect size for your kitchen and any other high traffic area you want to put. Package includes 1 Cekene kitchen mat for floor. WARM NOTE: The kitchen runner rug is folded in package, please iron the kitchen runner rug at a low to medium heat to flatten if there’s crease on it after receiving. [Qualified&Durable Material]--The kitchen rug runner is made of high quality polypropylene, non odor, toxic-free, non-shedding. It can scrape dirt, dust, sand and absorb moisture from your shoes as well. Moreover, the premium material also makes the kitchen carpet runner long-lasting and durable, you do not need to replace it frequently. [Non Slip Kitchen Floor Mat]--The Kitchen standing mat applies TPR backing technology and can stay in place on various floors, e.g. wooden, marble, tile floor, etc., ensuring the safety of you, your family and pets. WARM NOTE: Please place the kitchen rug on dry, clean, smooth floor only, otherwise, it may not non-slip. Easy to Clean&Fiber-locking]--The upgrading fiber-locking technology adopted makes the polypropylene fiber solid and not easy to fall off, which has solved the problem of large amount of fibers falling from the rug. Therefore, when it gets dirty, you can simply clean with a hand-held vacuum, sweep with a broom, or use the washing machine for deeper cleaning. [Versatile Kitchen Rug]--The Cekene kitchen rug is perfect for various situations: your kitchen floor, laundry room, etc. It can also be used as indoor entrance doormats, runner rugs for hallways, entryway runner carpet. Moreover, you can get the kitchen floor rug as a gift for your beloved family and friends. Very practical and worth-buying products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ABRro4PcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cekene","source_asin":"B091FD6675","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091FD6675","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091FD6675","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":801901,"name":"Madison Park Averly 6 Piece Duvet Cover Set, Grey, Cal King, King/California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W3pai7NEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spruce up your bedroom with the overly duvet cover set. It's delicate ogee pattern features an intricate leaf motif inside for a textured look. The charcoal Grey gives a modern look to this updated pattern and includes three decorative pillows with embroidery and fabric manipulation techniques to pull this whole look together. A duvet cover is a protective cover for your comforter, most likely for your down comforter. Sometimes it's referred to as a comforter cover. Duvet covers are not filled. It has an opening where you can insert your comforter. Filler not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W3pai7NEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B019ZIAPHA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-801901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019ZIAPHA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019ZIAPHA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
